tant to me that KOLUN ran well on this little device.And guess what? I did most of the game's testing on my Steam Deck! I tested the mechanics, controls, and performance, and sometimes just played while lying on the couch.KOLUN is ful","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T06:37:39Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706676531","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5124920-1844751498231800","game_id":"steam-5124920","kind":"announcement","title":"The KOLUN Demo Is Ready!","summary":"The KOLUN demo is finally finished.After a lot of work, testing and polishing, I'm happy to say that the demo is ready for release.You will step into the workplace as WORKER 1331. Pull the handle, get stumps, split them into pieces and load the resulting logs onto the cart.Earn Tickets for your work. Spend them on equipment upgrades and gradually make wood processing faster and more efficient.The KOLUN demo will be available on October 1, 2026 at 10:00 AM PDT.Thank you to everyone who has wishli","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T15:23:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498231800","verified_at":"2026-10-20T22:48:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5124920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:57Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:56Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5124920":"2026-10-26T08:42:57Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5124920":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:56Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:56Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:56Z"},"5184180":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:42:57Z","last_success_at":"2